- Machine_Type is in [Mill] and Vibration < 50  
- Temperature is within range [60, 75]  
- Humidity is within range [20, 35]  

10 different conditions for class "1":  
- Temperature >= 78  
- Vibration >= 48  
- Power_Usage < 9.5  
- Humidity >= 30  
